=== PREFLIGHT ===
Verified predecessor logs phase-33-00 through phase-33-05 all ended with EXIT=0 and STATUS=DONE.
Initial git status was clean before edits.
Applicable frontend and unit-conversion instructions were reviewed before changing web files.

=== SURVEY ===
CostForecastSection hid the Cost per kWh Trend GlassPanel behind forecastData historical length.
TemperatureSection hid the temperature summary body behind stats.hasAnyTemp and used custom empty markup for missing chart data.
DrivingSection hid the Top Drive GlassPanel behind metrics.topDrive and did not provide an EmptyState in that section.
GlancePage was a real route page without PageContainer.
YearReviewPage is a full-screen annual review story route.
SharedDrivePage is a public share route with branded chrome-less presentation for unauthenticated recipients.
WatchFacePage is a watch/PWA route for wearable-sized screens.

=== REASONING ===
Panels and chart shells should remain mounted so users see stable sections and explicit empty states instead of disappearing content.
GlancePage should use PageContainer because it is a normal authenticated route page.
YearReviewPage, SharedDrivePage, and WatchFacePage intentionally cannot use normal app chrome without breaking their full-screen, public share, or wearable UX, so each now has a code exception comment.

=== CHANGES ===
CostForecastSection now always renders the Cost per kWh Trend panel and shows EmptyState when historical data is insufficient.
TemperatureSection now renders EmptyState fallbacks for missing temperature summary or chart data and avoids data-only && rendering for summary cards and chart lines.
DrivingSection now keeps the daily distance chart shell and Top Drive panel visible with EmptyState fallbacks.
GlancePage now renders inside PageContainer while preserving loading, error, no-vehicle, command, and freshness states.
YearReviewPage, SharedDrivePage, and WatchFacePage now document their route-shell exceptions in code.

